  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n[ (-4)/(7) div (1)/(12)] div [- (4)/(5) times big{(-2)-(- (2)/(7)) big} ]\n\nConcept used:\n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/47485e25d1b30c57dc271863db8b99be0c8e209069b2596cc885911d898a8a78.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n**[ (-4)/(7) div (1)/(12)] div [- (4)/(5) times big{(-2)-(- (2)/(7)) big} ]**\n\n⇒ **[ (-4)/(7) times 12] div [- (4)/(5) times big{(-2)+((2)/(7)) big} ]**\n\n⇒ **[ (-48)/(7)] div [- (4)/(5) times ((-12)/(7)) big} ]**\n\n⇒ **[ (-48)/(7)] div [ (48)/(35) ]**\n\n⇒ **[ (-48)/(7)] times [ (35)/(48) ]**\n\n⇒ - 5",
